<title>USA: Atkinson says cleared for $152 mln job.</title>
<headline>Atkinson says cleared for $152 mln job.</headline>
<dateline>SAN BRUNO, Calif. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guy F. Atkinson Co said Friday its operating unit, Atkinson Construction Co, had received clearance to begin work on a $152.4 million highway tunnel in Boston.</p>
<p>The Massachusetts Highway Department gave its go-ahead on excavation support for a segment of the I-90 Central Artery/Tunnel project, Atkinson said.</p>
<p>Construction is scheduled to begin in September, with completion planned for July 2000.</p>
</text>
